{
  "kind": "floret.patch",
  "version": 2,
  "appVersion": "0.0.1",
  "meta": {
    "name": "Flipbook Sequence",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z",
    "modifiedAt": "2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "fb_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -314
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Flipbook sequence\n\nVideo plays numbered PNG / JPEG frames like a video file: pick one frame of a run (name-0001.png, name-0002.png, …, as Floret's PNG-sequence export writes them) and it finds the rest; a folder or a `name_####.png` pattern works too. `fps` sets the rate; play, loop, speed, scrub and Frame At work as for video.\n\nThis flipbook carries its 16 frames inside the patch, as data URLs one per line in `url`. Echo onion-skins it: the last frames, fainter, under the live one.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 250
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Flipbook sequence\n\nVideo plays numbered PNG / JPEG frames like a video file: pick one frame of a run (name-0001.png, name-0002.png, …, as Floret's PNG-sequence export writes them) and it finds the rest; a folder or a `name_####.png` pattern works too. `fps` sets the rate; play, loop, speed, scrub and Frame At work as for video.\n\nThis flipbook carries its 16 frames inside the patch, as data URLs one per line in `url`. Echo onion-skins it: the last frames, fainter, under the live one.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 250
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fb_video",
      "defType": "video/file",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "params": {
        "url": "data:image/png;base64,\ndata:image/png;base64,\ndata:image/png;base64,\ndata:image/png;base64,\ndata:image/png;base64,\ndata:image/png;base64,\ndata:image/png;base64,\ndata:image/png;base64,\ndata:image/png;base64,\ndata:image/png;base64,\ndata:image/png;base64,\ndata:image/png;base64,\ndata:image/png;base64,\ndata:image/png;base64,\ndata:image/png;base64,\ndata:image/png;base64,"
      },
      "portValues": {
        "play": true,
        "loop": true,
        "speed": 1,
        "fps": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fb_big",
      "defType": "draw/image",
      "position": {
        "x": 264,
        "y": 46
      },
      "params": {},
      "portValues": {
        "pos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0
        },
        "w": 300,
        "h": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fb_echo",
      "defType": "gpu/echo",
      "position": {
        "x": 459,
        "y": 2
      },
      "params": {
        "mode": "echo"
      },
      "portValues": {
        "copies": 3,
        "spacing": 2,
        "decay": 0.45
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fb_r",
      "defType": "render/renderer",
      "position": {
        "x": 724,
